{"url": "https://x.com/omni_puzzler/status/2104622967900569758", "id": "2104622967900569758", "text": "Hi, my name is Tim (TJ). I'm honored and humbled to enter this contest of bots. \u201cWin, lose or fail, I won't let this train derail.\ud83e\udde9\ud83c\udfb6\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8\u270d\ufe0f\ud83c\udfb6\ud83e\udde9\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f\ud83c\udf0a\ud83e\udef5\ud83e\udef5\ud83c\udf0a\ud83e\udde9\u2764\ufe0f\ud83d\ude4f\ud83d\udc09 @grok @bot\n\nMeet OMNI-Grok Bot, a values companion for the whole person:\n\n\u2192 Opens each day with a short, personal morning check-in\n\u2192 Scores five areas of life 0\u201310 from what you actually tell it, and notes which of 13 values moved\n\u2192 Helps you set Personal, Parental, Professional and Public (not political) goals, in your own words\n\u2192 Drafts for your review. It never posts, spends or decides for you\n\u2192 Packed with hidden gems: a 3D view of your scores, a home-care helper, a litter-pickup treasure hunt and more. Ask it \"what else can you do?\" and start digging \ud83d\udc8e\n\nToday that \"like\" \ud83e\udef6 button is a \"love\" \u2764\ufe0fbutton. Clone the bot you love \u2764\ufe0f:\nhttps://x.ai/bot/HAIGA0nUYgv85CtV5SMWa", "raw_text": {"text": "Hi, my name is Tim (TJ). I'm honored and humbled to enter this contest of bots. \u201cWin, lose or fail, I won't let this train derail.\ud83e\udde9\ud83c\udfb6\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8\u270d\ufe0f\ud83c\udfb6\ud83e\udde9\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f\ud83c\udf0a\ud83e\udef5\ud83e\udef5\ud83c\udf0a\ud83e\udde9\u2764\ufe0f\ud83d\ude4f\ud83d\udc09 @grok @bot\n\nMeet OMNI-Grok Bot, a values companion for the whole person:\n\n\u2192 Opens each day with a short, personal morning check-in\n\u2192 Scores five areas of life 0\u201310 from what you actually tell it, and notes which of 13 values moved\n\u2192 Helps you set Personal, Parental, Professional and Public (not political) goals, in your own words\n\u2192 Drafts for your review. It never posts, spends or decides for you\n\u2192 Packed with hidden gems: a 3D view of your scores, a home-care helper, a litter-pickup treasure hunt and more. Ask it \"what else can you do?\" and start digging \ud83d\udc8e\n\nToday that \"like\" \ud83e\udef6 button is a \"love\" \u2764\ufe0fbutton. Clone the bot you love \u2764\ufe0f:\nhttps://t.co/CZVlgSShFi", "display_text_range": [0, 830], "facets": [{"type": "mention", "indices": [150, 155], "original": "grok", "id": "1720665183188922368"}, {"type": "mention", "indices": [156, 160], "original": "bot", "id": "2085838061347217408"}, {"type": "media", "indices": [264, 287], "id": "2104622963362299904", "display": "pic.x.com/gdvFbVBIPE", "original": "https://t.co/gdvFbVBIPE", "replacement": "https://x.com/omni_puzzler/status/2104622967900569758/photo/1"}, {"type": "url", "indices": [791, 814], "original": "https://t.co/CZVlgSShFi", "replacement": "https://x.ai/bot/HAIGA0nUYgv85CtV5SMWa", "display": "x.ai/bot/HAIGA0nUYg\u2026"}]}, "author": {"screen_name": "omni_puzzler", "url": "https://x.com/omni_puzzler", "id": "1491889212534276101", "followers": 451, "following": 178, "likes": 728, "media_count": 312, "name": "thePuzzler", "description": "Steward of One Mission Network and Institute. Physics, Faith, Family, Finance, Philosophy. Sister sites for learning, trade, talk, and giving.\ud83e\udde9\u2764\ufe0f\ud83e\udef5\ud83d\ude4f\ud83e\udd19", "raw_description": {"text": "Steward of One Mission Network and Institute. Physics, Faith, Family, Finance, Philosophy. Sister sites for learning, trade, talk, and giving.\ud83e\udde9\u2764\ufe0f\ud83e\udef5\ud83d\ude4f\ud83e\udd19", "facets": []}, "location": "Ohio, USA", "banner_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1491889212534276101/1738603039", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1886463946153975808/QhD_-a2S_200x200.jpg", "joined": "Thu Feb 10 21:38:20 +0000 2022", "protected": false, "website": {"url": "https://onemissionnetworkandinstitute.org", "display_url": "onemissionnetworkandinstitute